{"seq":1,"slug":"fp-in-mainstream-languages","title":"主流语言中的函数式编程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/practice/fp-in-mainstream-languages","wordCount":932,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"主流语言中的函数式编程实践\">主流语言中的函数式编程实践</h1><p>纯函数式语言（Haskell、Elm、PureScript）是 FP 思想的发源地和实验场，但绝大多数工程团队不会为了 FP 而更换技术栈。好消息是：FP 的核心技术——不可变值、高阶函数、ADT、Option/Result 链式处理——已被主流语言深度吸收。本文给出一条「渐进式 FP」路线：在保持现有代码库和团队能力的前提下，逐步引入函数式技术获得可测试性、并发安全性和可组合性收益。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「渐进式 FP」的核心策略：不必全盘切换到函数式语言，而是在现有语言和代码库中逐步引入 FP 技术——从纯函数习惯开始，经过不可变数据、Option/Result 链式处理、高阶组合子，最终到达 Effect System。每一层独立提供价值，团队可以在任何一层停下来而不必继续深入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"各语言的-fp-支持成熟度\">各语言的 FP 支持成熟度</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>不可变优先</th>\n<th>ADT/Union</th>\n<th>模式匹配</th>\n<th>HKT/Typeclass</th>\n<th>函数组合</th>\n<th>主要 FP 库</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TypeScript</td>\n<td><code>readonly</code>/<code>as const</code></td>\n<td>Tagged Union</td>\n<td>穷尽 switch</td>\n<td>模拟（Effect）</td>\n<td>pipe</td>\n<td>Effect-TS v4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rust</td>\n<td>默认不可变</td>\n<td><code>enum</code></td>\n<td>原生 <code>match</code></td>\n<td>Trait + GAT</td>\n<td>链式方法</td>\n<td>— (语言内建)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kotlin</td>\n<td><code>val</code>/data class</td>\n<td>sealed class</td>\n<td><code>when</code> 穷尽</td>\n<td>模拟（Arrow）</td>\n<td>extension fun</td>\n<td>Arrow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scala 3</td>\n<td>case class/enum</td>\n<td>enum + sealed</td>\n<td>原生 match</td>\n<td>原生 HKT</td>\n<td>原生组合</td>\n<td>ZIO/Cats/Kyo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java 21+</td>\n<td>record + sealed</td>\n<td>sealed interface</td>\n<td>switch 表达式</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>Stream API</td>\n<td>Vavr</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>dataclass(frozen)</td>\n<td>Union type hint</td>\n<td>match (3.10+)</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>functools</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>— (极度有限)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"渐进式-fp-路线图\">渐进式 FP 路线图</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    L1[&quot;Level 1: 纯函数习惯&quot;]&#10;    L2[&quot;Level 2: 不可变数据优先&quot;]&#10;    L3[&quot;Level 3: Option/Result 链式处理&quot;]&#10;    L4[&quot;Level 4: 高阶函数与组合子&quot;]&#10;    L5[&quot;Level 5: Effect System&quot;]&#10;    L1 --&gt; L2 --&gt; L3 --&gt; L4 --&gt; L5&#10;    L1 --- D1[&quot;避免副作用、函数无外部依赖&quot;]&#10;    L2 --- D2[&quot;const/readonly/val、避免 mutation&quot;]&#10;    L3 --- D3[&quot;消灭 null/undefined/exception&quot;]&#10;    L4 --- D4[&quot;map/filter/reduce + 自定义组合子&quot;]&#10;    L5 --- D5[&quot;依赖注入+错误+并发全部类型化&quot;]\">graph TD\n    L1[\"Level 1: 纯函数习惯\"]\n    L2[\"Level 2: 不可变数据优先\"]\n    L3[\"Level 3: Option/Result 链式处理\"]\n    L4[\"Level 4: 高阶函数与组合子\"]\n    L5[\"Level 5: Effect System\"]\n    L1 --&gt; L2 --&gt; L3 --&gt; L4 --&gt; L5\n    L1 --- D1[\"避免副作用、函数无外部依赖\"]\n    L2 --- D2[\"const/readonly/val、避免 mutation\"]\n    L3 --- D3[\"消灭 null/undefined/exception\"]\n    L4 --- D4[\"map/filter/reduce + 自定义组合子\"]\n    L5 --- D5[\"依赖注入+错误+并发全部类型化\"]</pre><p><strong>Level 1：纯函数习惯</strong>——将函数写成无副作用的映射。不读全局变量、不改参数、不做 IO。副作用推到调用栈最外层。这一步无需任何新库，只需纪律。</p>\n<p><strong>Level 2：不可变数据优先</strong>——用 <code>const</code>/<code>readonly</code>/<code>val</code>/<code>&amp;</code> 作为默认。数据更新通过创建新副本而非原地修改。配合结构共享库（Immer for TS、persistent collections for JVM）控制性能。</p>\n<p><strong>Level 3：Option/Result 消灭 null</strong>——用 <code>Option&lt;T&gt;</code> 替代 <code>T | null</code>，用 <code>Result&lt;T, E&gt;</code> 替代 try/catch。链式 <code>.map().flatMap()</code> 替代嵌套 if-null 检查。TypeScript 的 Effect 库、Rust 语言内建、Kotlin 的 Arrow 都提供了这一层。</p>\n<p><strong>Level 4：高阶函数与组合子</strong>——将业务逻辑表达为 pipeline：输入 → transform → validate → enrich → output。每一步是独立可测试的纯函数，管道组合器负责串联。</p>\n<p><strong>Level 5：Effect System</strong>——将依赖注入、错误处理、并发控制全部类型化。这是最大的收益层，也是学习曲线最陡的一步。Effect-TS v4（TypeScript）和 ZIO 2（Scala）是 2026 年两个最成熟的选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"typescript-effect-ts-实战示例\">TypeScript + Effect-TS 实战示例</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Effect, Layer, Context, pipe } from &#39;effect&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 定义服务接口&#10;class UserRepo extends Context.Tag(&#39;UserRepo&#39;)&lt;&#10;  UserRepo,&#10;  { readonly findById: (id: string) =&gt; Effect.Effect&lt;User, NotFoundError&gt; }&#10;&gt;() {}&#10;&#10;// 业务逻辑：纯函数式，依赖类型化&#10;const getActiveUser = (id: string) =&gt;&#10;  pipe(&#10;    UserRepo,&#10;    Effect.flatMap((repo) =&gt; repo.findById(id)),&#10;    Effect.filterOrFail(&#10;      (user) =&gt; user.isActive,&#10;      () =&gt; new InactiveUserError(id),&#10;    ),&#10;  );&#10;&#10;// 注入实现：在程序边界&#10;const ProdUserRepo = Layer.succeed(UserRepo, {&#10;  findById: (id) =&gt;&#10;    Effect.tryPromise({&#10;      try: () =&gt; db.query(`SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = $1`, [id]),&#10;      catch: () =&gt; new NotFoundError(id),&#10;    }),&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 测试注入：纯函数式 mock&#10;const TestUserRepo = Layer.succeed(UserRepo, {&#10;  findById: (id) =&gt; Effect.succeed({ id, name: &#39;Test&#39;, isActive: true }),&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Effect, Layer, Context, pipe } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'effect'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 定义服务接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserRepo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Tag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UserRepo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)&#x3C;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  UserRepo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">readonly</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findById</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Effect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Effect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NotFoundError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>() {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 业务逻辑：纯函数式，依赖类型化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getActiveUser</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    UserRepo,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Effect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flatMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">repo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> repo.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Effect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filterOrFail</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user.isActive,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InactiveUserError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 注入实现：在程序边界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ProdUserRepo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Layer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">succeed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(UserRepo, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Effect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tryPromise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = $1`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [id]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NotFoundError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 测试注入：纯函数式 mock</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TestUserRepo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Layer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">succeed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(UserRepo, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Effect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">succeed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ id, name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Test'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, isActive: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"rust-语言级别的-fp-内建\">Rust：语言级别的 FP 内建</h2><p>Rust 不自称函数式语言，但它的核心设计深受 FP 影响：默认不可变、<code>enum</code> 即和类型、<code>match</code> 即模式匹配、<code>Option</code>/<code>Result</code> 即 Monad、所有权即线性类型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// Rust 的 Option/Result 链式处理&#10;fn process_config(path: &amp;str) -&gt; Result&lt;Config, AppError&gt; {&#10;    std::fs::read_to_string(path)&#10;        .map_err(|e| AppError::Io(e))&#10;        .and_then(|content| toml::from_str(&amp;content)&#10;            .map_err(|e| AppError::Parse(e)))&#10;        .map(|raw| Config::from(raw))&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Iterator 就是 FP 的 lazy stream&#10;let result: Vec&lt;i32&gt; = data.iter()&#10;    .filter(|x| x.is_valid())&#10;    .map(|x| x.value * 2)&#10;    .take(10)&#10;    .collect();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Rust 的 Option/Result 链式处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn process_config(path: &#x26;str) -> Result&#x3C;Config, AppError> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    std::fs::read_to_string(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map_err(|e| AppError::Io(e))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .and_then(|content| toml::from_str(&#x26;content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .map_err(|e| AppError::Parse(e)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(|raw| Config::from(raw))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Iterator 就是 FP 的 lazy stream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let result: Vec&#x3C;i32> = data.iter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .filter(|x| x.is_valid())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .map(|x| x.value * 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .take(10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .collect();</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"团队引入-fp-的务实建议\">团队引入 FP 的务实建议</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>从 Level 1-2 开始</strong>——不可变 + 纯函数不需要新库，立即可获测试性改善</li>\n<li><strong>选一个「桥梁」库</strong>——Effect-TS / Arrow / Vavr，让团队在熟悉语言中体验 FP</li>\n<li><strong>新代码 FP、旧代码不改</strong>——避免大规模重构的风险</li>\n<li><strong>用 ADT 建模领域</strong>——这是 ROI 最高的 FP 技术，任何类型化语言都支持</li>\n<li><strong>Effect System 是最后一步</strong>——等团队对 Level 1-4 舒适后再引入</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>FP 核心技术已被主流语言吸收，无需切换语言即可获益</li>\n<li>渐进路线：纯函数 → 不可变 → Option/Result → 组合子 → Effect System</li>\n<li>TypeScript(Effect-TS) 和 Rust 是 2026 年 FP 实践的两个优质入口</li>\n<li>团队引入 FP 应从低学习成本的层开始，按需逐步深入</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../patterns/effect-systems\">Effect System 与类型化副作用</a> — Level 5 的完整理论与框架对比</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../concurrency-models/other-models-and-significance/immutability\">并发模型 hub：不可变性与并发</a> — 不可变数据如何天然支持并发安全</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"主流语言中的函数式编程实践","id":"主流语言中的函数式编程实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"各语言的 FP 支持成熟度","id":"各语言的-fp-支持成熟度"},{"level":2,"text":"渐进式 FP 路线图","id":"渐进式-fp-路线图"},{"level":2,"text":"TypeScript + Effect-TS 实战示例","id":"typescript-effect-ts-实战示例"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust：语言级别的 FP 内建","id":"rust-语言级别的-fp-内建"},{"level":2,"text":"团队引入 FP 的务实建议","id":"团队引入-fp-的务实建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"光学：Lens、Prism 与 Traversal","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/patterns/optics-lens-prism"},"next":{"title":"Property-Based Testing 与函数式测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typed-functional-programming/practice/property-based-testing"}}